-- title:
--   Norm along the q↦ q^ℓ degeneracy as a product of twists
-- statement:
--   Let $L$ be a field equipped with a $\mathbb{Q}$-algebra structure and let $N,\ell\ge 1$. Inside $L((q))$ put $F=$ `laurentBaseChange L (x1FunctionField N)`, the subfield generated over $L$ by the coefficientwise images of the $q$-expansion function field $\mathbb{Q}$-generated by the integral form ratios for $\Gamma_1(N)$, and $F'=$ `laurentBaseChange L (x1x0FunctionFieldC ℚ N (N*ℓ))`, likewise for $\Gamma_1(N)\cap\Gamma_0(N\ell)$. Assume: the Laurent series `jqModC L`, namely $q^{-1}$ times the image of the power series `jNum`, lies in $F$; the predicate `HeckeBetaOneDefined N ℓ` holds, i.e. for every $y$ in the $q$-expansion field of $\Gamma_1(N)$ over $\mathbb{Q}$ the substitution $q\mapsto q^{\ell}$ (the map `qExpand ℚ ℓ`, given by rescaling exponents by $\ell$) carries $y$ into the $q$-expansion field of $\Gamma_1(N)\cap\Gamma_0(N\ell)$, so that `heckeBetaOneBar L N ℓ` is the resulting $L$-algebra map $\beta\colon F\to F'$ induced by $q\mapsto q^{\ell}$; the rank of $F'$ as an $F$-module along $\beta$ equals $\ell$; and $\zeta\in L^{\times}$ has image a primitive $\ell$-th root of unity in $L$. Then for every $y\in F'$, with $F'$ an $F$-algebra along $\beta$, the Laurent series underlying $\beta\bigl(N_{F'/F}(y)\bigr)$ equals $\prod_{i=0}^{\ell-1}$ `qTwist` $(\zeta^{i})$ applied to the Laurent series underlying $y$, where `qTwist u` is the ring endomorphism of $L((q))$ multiplying the coefficient of $q^{k}$ by $u^{k}$, i.e. $f(q)\mapsto f(uq)$.
--
--   This is the function-field form of the statement that the conjugates of $f(\tau)$ over the field generated by $f(\ell\tau)$ are the functions $f(\tau+i/\ell)$: the norm along the degeneracy map $q\mapsto q^{\ell}$ is the product of the $\ell$ twists $q\mapsto \zeta^{i}q$. It is used in the construction of Hecke correspondences on models of $X_1(N)$, in particular in the computation of Hecke divisors on charts and of their reductions.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_ModularCurve_coe_heckeBetaOneBar_norm_eq_prod_qTwist_of_finrankAlong_eq.lean

